# === KEEPER SERVICE (keeper/) ==============================================
# Not read from this file. The keeper runs on Railway and its settings,
# including its private key, live only in Railway's service variables. See
# keeper/README.md for the full list. Public addresses, for reference:
#   keeper key    0x317C1B41f5E1C49766e7c467FE3dE5f0823E35fd  (multisig signer + HaltController keeper, all 5 markets)
#   watchdog key  0xFf4266eAB1289bA854A674b049884C7B44007c08  (calls sync() only)
